--[[
Alright, first off thanks for using this model in your game!
I'll get to the chase.
Step 1) Get the mesh of your weapon and clone it to the "Scene Brick"
Step 2) Edit the WeaponName to the weapons name and paste the weapon to the lighting
Step 3) Edit TexName to the name that you want the gui to display on the giver.
Step 4) Edit the RegenTime to the time between regenerations.
